#: scripts/m0_state.gd:203
msgid ""
"You said \"%s\"\n"
"I made my call. You cranked the bypass anyway. I stayed."
msgstr ""
"你說過「%s」。\n"
"我做了我的決定。你還是轉動了旁路。我留了下來。"

