# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Credits paragraph (582 px, 19 px, wraps). Translated word for word.
#. i18n: speaker=ui
#. TRANSLATORS: The AI disclosure Nathanial Henniges approved word for word (October 19, 2026). Translate it faithfully and in full; do not shorten, soften or add to it. Keep WOLF OVERRIDE, Nathanial Henniges and MrDemonWolf, Inc. as written.
#: scripts/main.gd:2038
msgid "WOLF OVERRIDE is a solo project by Nathanial Henniges (MrDemonWolf, Inc.). AI tools were used with careful human oversight to support the creative process for art and code. The story, characters and game design are his, and every AI-assisted asset is reviewed, edited and credited."
msgstr "WOLF OVERRIDE 是 Nathanial Henniges（MrDemonWolf, Inc.）的個人專案。AI 工具在細緻的人工監督下使用，用於輔助美術和程式碼的創作過程。故事、角色和遊戲設計均出自他本人，所有藉助 AI 的素材都經過審閱、編輯並註明署名。"

